#   pnut-<commit>       pnut at the commit seed-forth vendored; only
#                       portable_libc/ is unpacked, the libc compiled into
#                       the first tcc
#   live-bootstrap-<commit>  live-bootstrap's tree; the junction check runs
#                       its steps/mes-0.28 and steps/tcc-0.9.26 kaem text and
#                       compares with their checksums files
# The pnut and live-bootstrap archives are generated by GitHub from the
# commit, and GitHub does not promise their bytes stay the same.  If one
# changes, the commit in its name is the identity of the source: compare
# `git archive` of that commit with the new archive's contents before
# moving its pin.
